OL,3,ASchools in lockdown and boy in hospital
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo schools are in lockdown as armed
OL,6,Fpolice search for a group of people
OL,7,Finvolved in an altercation that left a
OL,8,Fboy injured.
OL,10,FOne male was seen with a "long-bladed
OL,11,Fitem" during the incident outside St
OL,12,FPeter's High School in Gloucester,
OL,13,Fpolice said.
OL,15,FArmed officers are now searching for a
OL,16,Fgroup involved who fled the area. The
OL,17,Fforce said one boy had been taken to
OL,18,Fhospital with minor injuries and there
OL,19,Fwas "no ongoing threat at the school".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
