OL,3,ASchools in lockdown and boy in hospital
OL,4,
OL,5,FAlthough pupils still cannot leave St
OL,6,FPeter's High School alone, parents have
OL,7,Fnow been told they can collect their
OL,8,Fchildren. Nearby Willow Primary Academy
OL,9,Fremains in full lockdown.
